# Normalize every text file to LF in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic. `Session::source_hash` is the sha256 of a session file's
# bytes, and the pipeline snapshots embed it. On Windows, git's default
# `core.autocrlf=true` checks fixtures out with CRLF, which produced a different
# hash and failed
# `deterministic_artifacts_are_snapshotted_for_every_provider` on the Windows CI
# job while macOS and Linux passed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Archives and images are bytes, not text. Never let git touch them.
*.zst binary
*.gz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
